| **G1 – Deliver Resources to Requesting Agent**    | The robot system must collect required resources from storage and deliver them to the requesting agent at a specified location.  | `;` (sequential) | Perform       | –                                           | AND          | Both collection and delivery phases must be completed one after the other to satisfy the mission. |                    |                    |                    |
