| **G3.6 – Report**                                 | The robot sends a report detailing the failure to the sector manager.                                                            | `-`              | Perform       | –                                           | AND          | Reporting is part of failure handling.                                                            |                    |                    |                    |
| **G3.7 – Parallelize Delivery Tasks**             | The system coordinates multiple robots to deliver resources concurrently to the destination.                                     | `#`              | Perform       | –                                           | AND          | Parallel delivery reduces overall mission time when multiple items are needed.                    |                    |                    |                    |


